WEBVTT

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.150
Now, the ceremonious match.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.170
Il Re's entrance!

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:51.580
What do you want?

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.380
I have business inside.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:54.960
Go back.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.640
No one is allowed to enter today.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.030
Why's that?

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.720
There's a match in the colosseum.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.450
A challenger for Il Re appeared.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:04.690
Il Re?

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.020
Colosseum?

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:07.460
Thought so...

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.930
Got it? Now leave.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.680
Coming through.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:14.660
Hey, you!

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.380
What?

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:34.240
This time,

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.660
we can fight without anyone interrupting.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.610
We'll settle this now.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:06.110
Distractions day after day, it's always something

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:06.110
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:10.250
and no one has even realized that

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:15.270
I see the crimson trailing down your cold skin

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:15.270
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:19.460
Why do you want another punishment?

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:19.460
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.210
The sweet fragrances that are drifting about

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.210
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.770
I just want to leave them be

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.770
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:36.450
Someone hurry up and shoot me

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:36.450
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:41.600
Show me a gunshot strong enough to make a hole

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:41.600
Show me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:46.070
I crush my thorny grip

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:46.070
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubushite

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:51.840
and load bullets that look like ripe flowerbuds

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:51.840
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:55.950
Let me shoot through the soul

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:55.950
Let me, shot through the soul

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:00.900
and dye it rose

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:00.900
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:22.280
Stop!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:25.670
Damn you!

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.000
Intruder!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:35.890
Get him!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.700
The colosseum must be in here.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.370
You'll die if you don't take me seriously.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:04:00.240
You always loved collecting things.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.790
I'll send you to your friends.

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:13.680
Trash...

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:22.560
That's all you are.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.500
I'm not done yet!

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:49.460
Shall I let you out of your misery?

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.620
W-What's he doing here?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.610
Him?

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.970
Are you Il Re?

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.900
What are you doing here?

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.170
I'm not letting you kill Rin.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.930
I see trash comes in sets of two.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.500
What makes you think you can escape?

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:35.930
It's the end for you.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.330
What was that?

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:49.480
Rin!

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.280
Come on, Rin!

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:17.520
You two, go and capture them!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:18.550
Quickly now!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:19.830
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:23.060
Wait a sec, geezer. Lemme take care of the bigger one.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.270
Listen!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:29.230
Only Akira must be captured unharmed!

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:36.260
Is that...

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.230
Let's go!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.330
Bravo!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.050
That was close.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:02.800
What was that about?

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:07.820
It's probably the CFC's attack.
Seems they've started the invasion.

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.160
That's not what I asked.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.220
Why are you after that man?

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.130
Th-That man...

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:21.600
B-Because he disturbed Il Re's battle, of course.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.520
Don't play dumb.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.410
If you hold your life dear, start telling the truth.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:31.650
Uh, why are you interested in that rat?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:37.000
I just want to know the reason why you want him captured unharmed.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:40.610
Null Nicole.

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.430
Do you understand now?

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.130
Null Nicole?

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:57.480
Are you all right?

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.370
This way.

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:30.980
Rin?

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.730
Kill me already!

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:36.100
I've had enough, so why don't you just kill me?!

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.680
Kill me, kill me please!

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.650
Kill me!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:40.150
Rin!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.790
Calm down!

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.990
Why...

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.520
couldn't you just leave me alone?!

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:53.200
Don't be stupid.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:54.960
Damn!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.380
That was totally unnecessary!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.510
Why did you get involved in this?!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:04.680
The way you do things, it's just for your hypocritical self-satisfaction!

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:10.040
Rin, were you after Il Re?

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.130
That's right!

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.930
For what he did to my friends.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:15.640
But you had to interfere!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.150
I was gonna die! Then it all would've been over!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:23.070
I don't wanna let you die.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:26.020
But why?

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:27.490
I betrayed you!

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.580
When I came for your tags,

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.290
I was seriously ready to kill you!

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:35.960
Why do you care about me?!

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:37.740
Just let me be!

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:46.430
Is believing in someone really that scary?

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:53.770
You can believe and trust someone, but you might get pushed away someday.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.340
Isn't that scary?

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:59.710
You speak like you know everything!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:00.900
Shut up!

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:06.050
You keep people at a distance on purpose by acting the way you do

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:08.700
so that you'll never be betrayed again.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.770
And that you'll never be hurt again.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:12.450
That's what it looks like to me.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.700
I told you to shut up!

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.910
You string together pretty words like that,

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:25.840
but they're all empty!

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:30.140
I won't betray you.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.700
Then...

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.350
prove it to me.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.310
I can't, but...

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:44.260
if you believe in me, I can prove it to you.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.660
If you betray me,

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:51.320
I'll kill you.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:56.250
I mean it. I'll kill you.

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.900
If I were to betray you, killing me would be appropriate.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.340
So let's get out of here together.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.570
Motomi is waiting for us in the church.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:07.740
Shall we go?

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:10.310
Fooound yooou~

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:15.070
We were lookin' for you ladies.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.140
It's our duty.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.080
Go on, Rin.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:23.960
Ya thinkin' of making a run for it?

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.320
Akira!

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.430
I'll meet you later!

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:35.100
See ya!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.240
Where do ya think you're going?

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.300
Only a fool would stay here with you!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.460
Pay attention to who you're fighting!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.130
Hey you!

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:58.600
Pain in the ass, stand still!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.940
Get over here!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.860
Don't run away!

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:11.540
Hey kitty, let's play!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.900
You can't escape!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.830
Lemme hear you scream!

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:41.520
Akira...?

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:09.840
Where'd he go?

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:21.410
Get out of the way.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.230
Found ya again!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.080
Let me go.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.710
Ain't you a real sweetie?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.020
But you got a nice look in your eyes.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:55.400
Different than those goddamn Line addicts.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:14:00.640
Should I make you stiff with fear or writhe in pain?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.180
Hey, why ain't you putting up a fight?!

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.650
Give up, you ain't getting away anymore.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.210
Let's have some fun before I kill you.

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.470
You...

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:09.030
What the fuck? Is he human?

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.710
Dirty tricks.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:31.300
Are you waiting for your friend or something?

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:34.670
Friend?

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.040
I'm always by myself.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.070
Don't you feel lonely?

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:43.120
I wonder...

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:46.060
What kind of feeling is "loneliness"?

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.770
Should I stay with you?

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.540
What about next time?

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:54.960
Next time?

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:58.920
If I don't stay with you today, should I next time? Or is that impossible?

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.970
It would be nice...

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:09.890
if we met again.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:14.730
Then it's a promise.

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:16.320
I don't lie.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:20.380
You're... holding my hand?

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.110
It feels warm.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.210
What is this?

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.170
In exchange for your promise.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:08.650
Keisuke!

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.050
Did you find the answer?

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:18.360
Trying not to see what is visible.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:22.070
Endeavoring to see what isn't visible.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.720
What is it?

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.010
It's a dream.

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:31.430
I know you, don't I?

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.490
Who exactly are you?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.420
Wait, please!

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:39.610
There's still things I want to--

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.610
It seems our guests have arrived.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:54.950
You?!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.920
Long time no see.

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:58.790
Why are you here?

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.250
Why do you think?

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.300
Wasn't the deal that I would defeat Il Re and that would be it?

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.120
Not quite.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.640
Our goal wasn't something that simple.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:11.720
Your goal?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.900
Yes.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.140
Our true goal...

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:18.670
was this man,

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:19.640
n.

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:22.270
What do you mean?

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:28.750
We sent so many men here in order to capture him.

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.450
They were from the same orphanage as you.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:36.340
And finally, we got a response.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:40.420
I thought it'd be worth throwing the Null Nicole into this.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.190
What are you talking about?

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:46.920
I'll be frank.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:52.130
I'm the one who set you up for that murder and sent you to Toshima.

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:56.330
So you could lure out n.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.440
Enough with the pointless talk.

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:08.400
Let's get to the main topic.

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.330
Wait, Emma.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.470
Our mission is to bring Premier back with us.

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.330
As if I didn't know that.

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.290
Please.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.750
I don't want to have to kill you.

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:35.510
I've made it this far for the sake of this day.

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:36.630
Emma!

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.240
Why did you...?

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.630
Why don't I tell you?

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.480
That man is called Nicole Premier.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.080
He's a military experiment.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.210
An experiment?

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:52.900
That's right.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:57.370
You were both made to manufacture Line.

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:00.820
Premier's blood is the same as Line.

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:06.840
And this man had the instructions to spread it here in Toshima.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.880
People are corrupt,

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.600
greedy, and shameful.

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:21.770
They bare their fangs at everyone else as they struggle to reach the top.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:25.560
And I'm no better than them.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:31.030
The army is coming to get you and take you back to a research facility.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:33.710
Who knows when it'll be over.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:36.020
Eternal agony is just beginning again.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.640
The only way to save you from it

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:41.250
is death.

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:52.030
Emma?

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:57.270
Emma!

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.830
Why?

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.760
In order to end it all,

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:21.790
I have soaked my hand in the essence of life.

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:25.780
So many lives already,

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.990
yet it's grasping for more.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:41.850
Who is he?

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:46.280
He's my friend.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:47.440
An important one.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.450
Bring him along.
